<title>USA: Two Cedar Hill, Texas, school deals free to trade.</title>
<headline>Two Cedar Hill, Texas, school deals free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>CEDAR HILL INDEPENDENT SCHOOL DISTRICT</p>
<p>RE: $25,018,040.50</p>
<p>(DALLAS COUNTY, TEXAS)</p>
<p>UNLIMITED TAX SCHOOL BUILDING AND REFUNDING</p>
<p>BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>Effective at 10:00 A.M. E.D.T., Friday, August 30, 1996 all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc.</p>
<p>Pryor, McClendon, Counts &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>PUBLIC PROPERTY FINANCE CONTRACTUAL OBLIGATIONS</p>
<p>RE: $675,000</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>CEDAR HILL INDEPENDENT SCHOOL DISTRICT</p>
<p>(DALLAS COUNTY, TEXAS)</p>
<p>Effective at 10:00 A.M. E.D.T., Friday, August 30, 1996 all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc.</p>
<p>Pryor, McClendon, Counts &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
